The issue is the mesh building process is taking a long time (4 + hours with consistent cpu usage and 6.5gb RAM, and counting!).

In terms of specs, I am running this on an amazon EC2 instance (g4dn.4xlarge) with 16 vCPU and 64GB ram - so thankfully we're not running out of RAM any time soon (touch wood)!

I just wanted to run it by you guys to ask, is it normal to take this long? I want to maintain a good resolution throughout the study area so I don't mind the wait if its actually working okay - has anyone tried global/ multi regional meshes before?

